      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Keiko Fukuichi, a freelance English-to-Japanese translator, specializes in localizing games of every size into Japanese. As a huge fan of Undertale herself, she naturally jumped at the chance to localize the game into Japanese. Some of her other professional indie localizations include:",
